===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[swimming]] [[pool]]}}

# A [[pool]] of water used for swimming, usually one which has been artificially constructed.
#* '''2009''', Sean Harvey, ''The Rough Guide to the Dominican Republic'' (ISBN 1858288118), page 321:
#*: Fortunately, a waterfall thrums down the nearby mountains and forms a natural '''swimming pool''' at the entrance.

